# Normalize line endings: text files are LF in the repo and on checkout — kills the Windows↔Linux
# CRLF churn (Windows dev + Linux CI). `text=auto` lets git detect binary files; `eol=lf` overrides
# any local core.autocrlf so checkouts stay LF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Belt-and-braces for common binaries (no diff/eol munging).
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.jks binary
*.keystore binary
*.p8 binary
*.p12 binary
